<html>
  <head>
    <title>JobCardPreInvoice</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter'; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px; /*
      Default font size */ } .header { text-align: right; padding: 0px 20px;
      margin-bottom: -10px; } .header img { max-width: 150px; } .line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin: 10px 0; } .branch-details,
      .customer-details, .booking-details { padding: 0 20px; } .center-text {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: darkred;
        } .details-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      margin: 20px 0; } .details-box { width: 48%; padding: 10px; } .details-box
      p { margin: 0; padding: 3px 0; /* Reduced padding */ font-size: 12px; /*
      Reduced font size for key-value pairs */ } .details-box .key {
      font-weight: bold; } .details-table, .items-table { width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0; } .details-table-new,
      .details-table-new1, .details-table-data { width: 100%; border-collapse:
      collapse; margin: 10px 0; } .details-condition{ margin-top: 150px; }
      .details-table-new th, .details-table-new td, .items-table th,
      .items-table td { border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 0px; /* Reduced
      padding */ text-align: left; font-size: 10px; /* Reduced font size for
      table content */ } .details-table-new1 th, .details-table-new1 td {
      border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 0px; /* Reduced padding */ text-align:
      left; font-size: 12px; /* Reduced font size for table content */
      vertical-align: top; } .details-table td { border: 1px solid #000;
      padding: 5px; /* Reduced padding */ text-align: left; font-size: 10px; /*
      Reduced font size for table content */ } .details-table-data td { border:
      1px solid #000; padding: 5px; /* Reduced padding */ text-align: right;
      font-size: 10px; } .details-table th, .details-table-data th { border: 1px
      solid #000; padding: 5px; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; } .footer {
      padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 12px; /* Reduced font size for footer
      content */ } .footer .signatures { display: flex; justify-content:
      space-between; } .bold { font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between'>
      <div style='display:flex'>
        <img
          src='data:image/png;base64,{{kiBase64Logo}}'
          alt='Logo'
          style='height: 75px; width: 75px;'
        />
        <table class='details-table-new' style='margin-left: 10px;'>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Ki Mobility Solutions Private Limited,
                <br />
                (Subsidiary of TVS Automobile Solutions PVT Ltd.,)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>{{outlet.address}},</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>{{outlet.city}},{{outlet.state}},{{outlet.pincode}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Mobile: {{outlet.mobile}},</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class='header'>
        <img
          src='data:image/png;base64,{{base64Logo}}'
          alt='Logo'
          style='height: 30px; width:100px'
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='line'></div>
    <table class='details-table-new1' style='width: 40%;'>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 45%;'>PAN</td>
          <td style='width: 10%;'>:</td>
          <td style='width: 45%;'></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 45%;'>GSTIN</td>
          <td style='width: 10%;'>:</td>
          <td style='width: 45%;'>{{outlet.dealerGstin}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 45%;'>CIN</td>
          <td style='width: 10%;'>:</td>
          <td style='width: 45%;'></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <div class='line'></div>
    <div class='center-text'>Tax Invoice</div>
    <div class='line'></div>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th colspan='2' style='text-align: center;'>BILLING TO</th>
          <th colspan='2' style='text-align: center;'>SHIP TO/Place of supply</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Insurance/Cust code</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.customer_code}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Customer Code</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.customer_code}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Insurance/Cust name</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.name}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Customer Name</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.name}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Insurer/Cust GSTIN</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.gstin}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Customer GSTIN</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.gstin}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Billing Address</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.address}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Delivery Address</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.address}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Document Name</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.documentName}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Model</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.model}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Document Date</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.documentDate}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Cust State Code</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.pincode}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Branch</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{outlet.name}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Vehicle Regd No</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.regNo}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Km Reading</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.kmReading}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table-data'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th
            colspan='16'
            style='border: #ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #000; text-align:left'
          >LABOURS</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style='width: 3%;'>SNO</th>
          <th>CODE</th>
          <th>DESCRIPTION</th>
          <th>HSN/SAC</th>
          <th>QTY</th>
          <th>TOTAL VALUE</th>
          {{! <th>TOT VAL with DEP</th> }}
          <th>DISC</th>
          {{! <th>Tax Val after DISC</th> }}
          <th>CGST %</th>
          <th>CGST</th>
          <th>SGST %</th>
          <th>SGST</th>
          <th>IGST %</th>
          <th>IGST</th>
          <th style='width: 10%;'>AMOUNT</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each labours}}
          <tr>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.sno}}</td>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.rot_code}}</td>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.description}}</td>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.hsn}}</td>
            <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
            <td>{{this.totalval}}</td>
            {{!-- <td>{{this.totalval}}</td> --}}
            <td>{{this.discount}}</td>
            {{!-- <td>{{this.valafterdisc}}</td> --}}
            <td>{{this.cgst}}</td>
            <td>{{this.cgstamt}}</td>
            <td>{{this.sgst}}</td>
            <td>{{this.sgstamt}}</td>
            <td>{{this.igst}}</td>
            <td>{{this.igstamt}}</td>
            <td>{{this.totalamt}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/each}}
        <tr>
          <td colspan='4' style='text-align: right;'>SUB TOTAL</td>
          <td>{{totalLaborQuantity}}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td>{{totalLaborDiscount}}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td>{{totalLaborSGst}}</td>
          {{! <td></td> }}
          <td></td>
          {{! <td></td> }}
          <td>{{totalLaborCGst}}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td>{{totalLaborIGst}}</td>
          <td>{{totalLaborAmount}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan='13' style='text-align: right;'>TOTAL GST on LABOURS</td>
          <td>{{totalGstOnLabor}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan='13' style='text-align: right;'>TOTAL DISCOUNT on LABOURS</td>
          <td>{{totalLaborDiscount}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan='13' style='text-align: right;'>TOTAL of LABOURS</td>
          <td>{{totalLaborAmount}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table-data'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th
            colspan='16'
            style='border: #ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #000; text-align:left'
          >SPARES</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style='width: 3%;'>SNO</th>
          <th>CODE</th>
          <th>DESCRIPTION</th>
          <th>HSN/SAC</th>
          <th>QTY</th>
          <th>PER QTY RATE</th>
          {{! <th>Taxable value</th>
                <th>DISC</th>
                <th>Tax Val after DISC</th> }}
          <th>CGST %</th>
          <th>CGST</th>
          <th>SGST %</th>
          <th>SGST</th>
          <th>IGST %</th>
          <th>IGST</th>
          <th style='width: 10%;'>AMOUNT</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each parts}}
          <tr>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.sno}}</td>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.code}}</td>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.description}}</td>
            <td style='text-align: center;'>{{this.hsn}}</td>
            <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
            <td>{{this.rate}}</td>
            {{!-- <td>{{this.totalval}}</td>
                <td>{{this.discount}}</td>
                <td>{{this.valafterdisc}}</td> --}}
            <td>{{this.cgst}}</td>
            <td>{{this.cgstamt}}</td>
            <td>{{this.sgst}}</td>
            <td>{{this.sgstamt}}</td>
            <td>{{this.igst}}</td>
            <td>{{this.igstamt}}</td>
            <td>{{this.totalamt}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/each}}
        <tr>
          <td colspan='4' style='text-align: right;'>SUB TOTAL</td>
          <td>{{totalPartsQuantity}}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td></td>
          <td>{{totalPartsCGst}}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td>{{totalPartsSGst}}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td>{{totalPartsIGst}}</td>
          <td>{{totalPartsAmount}}</td>
          {{! <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td> }}
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td colspan='12' style='text-align: right;'>TOTAL GST on SPARES</td>
          <td>{{totalGstOnParts}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{! <tr>
                <td colspan="12" style="text-align: right;">TOTAL DISCOUNT on SPARES</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr> }}
        <tr>
          <td colspan='12' style='text-align: right;'>TOTAL of SPARES</td>
          <td>{{totalPartsAmount}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{! <tr>
                <td colspan="12" style="text-align: right;">GRAND TOTAL</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr> }}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style='width: 20%;'>Total Labour Amount</th>
          <th style='width: 20%;'>Total Parts Amount</th>
          {{! <th style="width: 20%;">Total Labour &amp; Parts Amount</th> }}
          {{! <th style="width: 20%;">Excess and Salvage Charges</th> }}
          <th style='width: 20%;'>Payable Total Amount</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>{{totalLaborAmount}}</td>
          <td>{{totalPartsAmount}}</td>
          {{! <td></td> 
                <td></td>}}
          <td>{{totalLaborPartsAmount}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style='width: 50%;'>ADVICE</th>
          <th style='width: 50%;'> SERVICE ENGINEER REMARKS</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 50%;'>{{customer.customerVoice}}</td>
          <td style='width: 50%;'>{{customer.serviceEngineerRemarks}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <br />
    <div class='details-condition'>
      <table
        style='width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;'
      >
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style='text-align: center;'><u>TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</u></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
      </table>

      <p style="text-align: center;"><u>Conditions Of Sale</u></p>
      <p>
        1. Our risk and responsibility ceases on delivery of the goods from our 
        Premises or to carriers. Customers are kindly requested to examine the 
        goods before taking delivery.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span>
          2. All Sales tax local or Central &#40;wherever applicable&#41; which 
          may be levied or become leviable under any legislation now in force or 
          enacted hereafter shall be payable by the purchaser in addition to the 
          price quoted / charged by us.
        </span>
      </p>
      <p>
        3. In addition, handling charges at appropriate rates are not included in 
        the price quoted / charged will also be payable.
      </p>
      <p>
        4. The company is not liable for delays or no delivery due to contingencies 
        arising from War,Strikes, Labour or Political Agitation, Lockouts , Fire, Flood, 
        Drought, Delays on rail or at sea, Breakdown or other causes beyond the control 
        of the sellers, whether in course of transit or delivery. The sale is without 
        responsibility on the part of the sellers for any loss rising therefrom.
      </p>
      <p>
        5. Interest at 18% Per annum will be charged on overdue accounts and this will 
        accrue from the date of the bill.
      </p>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><u>Additional condition in respect of Sale of Parts</u></p>
      <p>
        1. Terms, Prices, Discounts and Special Quotation are not subject to repetition,
        Returned goods will not be accepted.
      </p>
      <p>
        2. We undertake no responsibility for breakage, shortage or leakage in transit
        in spite of our paying Careful attention to the despatch.
      </p>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><u>Additional condition in respect of Service</u></p>
      <p>
        1. Terms, Prices, Discounts and Special Quotation are not subject to repetition.
      </p>
      <p>
        2. The Company reserves the right to with hold delivery and detain the vehicle 
        spares entrusted to It for repairs by the Customer till its entire repair bills 
        including repair charges. Value of parts and Accessories and garage rent at 
        appropriate rates are paid by the customer before effecting Delivery of the 
        repaired vehicles/spares him/her.
      </p>
      <p>
        3. The company &#40;Seller/Reseller&#41; is entitled to being to sale any 
        vehicles/spares entrusted to it for repairs by customers by public auction or 
        private contract or otherwise in case its entire repair Bill including repair 
        charges and value of parts and accessories supplied, are not fully paid by the 
        customer within a period of 3 months from the date the company advise the customer 
        that the Repaired vehicle / spare is ready for delivery, and further reserves 
        its right to process against the customer for any shortfall ascertained to be 
        due to the company after adjusting the sale Proceeds less sale expenses.
      </p>
      <p>
        4. GST is applicable @ appropriate rate for works contract as GST provisions 
        in the respective states
      </p>
    </div>
    <br />
    <table class='details-table-new1'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th colspan='2' style='text-align: right; padding-top:10px;'>For
            {{outlet.name}}</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th
            style='padding-left:0px; padding-top:10px;'
          >______________________</th>
          <th
            style='text-align: right; padding-top:10px;'
          >______________________</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style='padding-left:0px; padding-top:10px;'>Customer Signature</th>
          <th style='text-align: right; padding-top:10px;'>Authorized Signature</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
    </table>
    {{! <div style="padding-top:600px;
            padding-left:300px;
            font-size: 50px;
            color: rgb(121, 121, 121);
            transform:rotate(-45deg);
            transform-origin:bottom left;
            text-align:center;
            opacity: 0.5;">This copy is Draft &amp; not Original
    </div> }}
  </body>
</html>